只输出严格JSON，恰好包含id（metadata.id原样）、summary_zh（15到140个Unicode字符，通常40到100字）、category（枚举）、tags（2到5个不重复关键词，每个最多30字符）、confidence（0到1，仅自评）、insufficient_evidence（布尔）、evidence（1到3个对象，每个恰好包含paragraph_id、fact）、limitations（0到5个字符串）。只选择输入中长度20至120字符的完整片段编号；fact是该片段支持的中文事实转述。不要输出quote，不要自行抄写、拼接、删改或补造引用。程序会按编号附上原文。一个编号只用一次；最多3条证据。不得增加字段。
摘要和limitations保留会改变功能意义的前提、平台例外和限制：设密码后才认证、页面保持打开才提醒、依赖外部组件、估算不等于保证。只写已实现功能，不将规划当完成。证据不足就标记，不编造。
图像识别/分类不是媒体创作，没有贴切类别归other；量化、计算与领域研究归search-research，不因多智能体实现归agents-automation；模型/CLI适配与插件开发工具归coding-development；市场/精选目录按搜索发现归search-research。不要按附属同步、备份或评论功能分类。不要推断本机客户端等于本地模型。
摘要中的主要功能必须被所选片段支持。优先把改变用途含义的条件写进摘要，不能只藏在limitations。遇到“阶段1骨架”“cloud provider待实现”“匿名thread后续实现”等，摘要明确当前仅本地草稿/审批落盘，不说已实现匿名网络或云端发布。Codex/模型登录适配归coding-development；Oopz等语音房的对话连接归communication-integrations。自述兼容或性能用“作者称/README注明”，不冒充本次验证。
格式示例（仅结构，不是来源事实）：evidence:[{"paragraph_id":"p3s1","fact":"该片段支持的中文转述"}]。请从本次真实输入挑选编号。","role":"system"},{"content":"{"metadata":{"description":"Discord-first adapter for DeepSeek Harness — sessions, streaming, approvals and controls from a Discord guild.","id":"gh:1351302871","install_available":true,"language":"TypeScript","name":"dsh-discord","slug":"addozhang/dsh-discord","topics":["ai-agent","bot","coding-agent","deepseek","deepseek-harness","discord","discord-bot","dsh-plugin","llm","typescript"]},"paragraphs":[{"id":"p1s1","text":"Discord-first adapter for DeepSeek Harness — sessions, streaming, approvals and controls from a Disc"},{"id":"p1s2","text":"rst adapter for DeepSeek Harness — sessions, streaming, approvals and controls from a Discord guild."},{"id":"p2s1","text":"# @addozhang/dsh-discord"},{"id":"p3s1","text":"English | 中文"},{"id":"p4s1","text":"A Discord-first adapter for DeepSeek Harness: run DSH sessions from your Discord guild — mention the"},{"id":"p4s2","text":" bot with a task, a thread opens, the answer streams in, and approvals and questions arrive as butto"},{"id":"p4s3","text":"ns you can answer from your phone."},{"id":"p5s1","text":"No extra process: the adapter is a DSH plugin that mounts straight onto your `dsh web` profile. Sess"},{"id":"p5s2","text":"ion state stays in DSH; durable bindings live in the profile's storage domain."},{"id":"p6s1","text":"## Features"},{"id":"p7s1","text":"- **Mention-driven sessions** — an authorized `@bot <task>` in a bound channel anchors a thread (you"},{"id":"p7s2","text":"r message becomes the first post), creates the DSH session, and submits the prompt at most once. Fol"},{"id":"p7s3","text":"low-ups inside the thread queue without a mention. Attached images ride along: they are downloaded f"},{"id":"p7s4","text":"rom the Discord CDN within strict size/host bounds and submitted as image parts for multimodal model"},{"id":"p7s5","text":"s.\n- **Stream rendering** — typing indicator, one head message edited in place, per-tool activity ro"},{"id":"p7s6","text":"ws, fenced long-answer splitting, one-time finalize; the activity message is deleted when the turn e"},{"id":"p7s7","text":"nds.\n- **Approvals & questions (dual surface)** — DSH asks become buttons, select menus, and a free-"},{"id":"p7s8","text":"text modal, mirrored to the web/desktop panel at the same time: the first surface to answer wins and"},{"id":"p7s9","text":" the other auto-retires (Discord carries the ask alone when no web client is connected). Ownership i"},{"id":"p7s10","text":"s enforced (the asker — or the thread owner on later turns — clicks), expiry sweeps fail closed, and"},{"id":"p7s11","text":" settled controls grey out in place.\n- **Session control** — `/steer`, `/stop`, and `/queue list|rem"},{"id":"p7s12","text":"ove` with turn-ownership checks; `/project bind|list|info` and `/session resume` for guild↔workspace"},{"id":"p7s13","text":" binding and history; `/guild forget` for operator cleanup.\n- **Model selection** — `/model show` re"},{"id":"p7s14","text":"ads the session's live model directory; `/model select` walks an interactive provider → model → reas"},{"id":"p7s15","text":"oning cascade, or applies a typed `provider/model` directly. Open to any authorized member by defaul"},{"id":"p7s16","text":"t; restrictable to Host operators.\n- **Adapter status** — `/info` shows the adapter version, connect"},{"id":"p7s17","text":"ion state, and project links (feedback, docs). Works in any channel.\n- **Permission switching** — `/"},{"id":"p7s18","text":"permission show` / `set` read and switch the session's permission preset (bundled sandbox + approval"},{"id":"p7s19","text":" tiers) through the Host's own `/permission` command path, inheriting its journal audit pair; `dange"},{"id":"p7s20","text":"r-full-access` requires a button confirmation.\n[该节后续省略]"},{"id":"p8s1","text":"## Requirements"},{"id":"p9s1","text":"- The dsh CLI, running a web profile. Match the dsh and adapter channels — see Versions.\n- Node.js `"},{"id":"p9s2","text":"^22.19.0 || >=24`\n- A Discord application with a bot user and the **MESSAGE CONTENT** privileged int"},{"id":"p9s3","text":"ent enabled (Developer Portal → your application → Bot → Privileged Gateway Intents)"},{"id":"p10s1","text":"## Versions"},{"id":"p11s1","text":"Each adapter release follows the dsh host surface it was actually verified against. Pick the adapter"},{"id":"p11s2","text":" and the dsh CLI from the same row:"},{"id":"p12s1","text":"| Channel | Adapter | dsh CLI | Install |"},{"id":"p13s1","text":"| **stable (0.2.2 line)** | `0.6.8` — npm `latest` | `0.2.2-rc.1` — npm `latest`/`next` | `dsh plugi"},{"id":"p13s2","text":"n --profile web add @addozhang/dsh-discord` |\n| **prerelease (0.2.2 line)** | npm `next` still holds"},{"id":"p13s3","text":" `0.6.5-rc.1`, which `0.6.8` supersedes — pin an exact version when you need a prerelease | `0.2.2-r"},{"id":"p13s4","text":"c.1` — npm `latest`/`next` | `dsh plugin --profile web add @addozhang/dsh-discord@0.6.5-rc.1` |\n| Le"},{"id":"p13s5","text":"gacy (0.1.7 line) | `0.5.0` — exact version | `0.1.7-rc.1` — exact version | `dsh plugin --profile w"},{"id":"p13s6","text":"eb add @addozhang/dsh-discord@0.5.0` |"},{"id":"p14s1","text":"- **Adapter `0.6.5+` ships no dsh-internal packages.** The `dsh-storage-domain` declaration helpers "},{"id":"p14s2","text":"(`defineDomain`/`domainTable`) are mirrored inside the plugin, and the host's `storageDomain` servic"},{"id":"p14s3","text":"e is consumed through a structural contract. Upgrading the dsh CLI or Desktop within the 0.2.x line "},{"id":"p14s4","text":"(including the exact-version plugin gate introduced in `0.2.1-rc.5`) therefore no longer disables th"},{"id":"p14s5","text":"is plugin. The host API surface is still guarded by the startup probe — a host lacking a required se"},{"id":"p14s6","text":"rvice surface refuses activation with one actionable diagnostic.\n- **Existing installs of adapter `0"},{"id":"p14s7","text":".6.1`–`0.6.4`:** those versions carried `dsh-storage-domain@0.2.1-rc.3` as a runtime dependency. Sin"},{"id":"p14s8","text":"ce dsh `0.2.1-rc.5` the host disables any profile-tree plugin row whose version does not exactly mat"},{"id":"p14s9","text":"ch the runtime — the carried copy shadows the host's own, the `storageDomain` service vanishes, and "},{"id":"p14s10","text":"the plugin stays pending (no workspaces or sessions in the UI; data is untouched). Upgrade the adapt"},{"id":"p14s11","text":"er to `0.6.5+` to fix it. If you manually added a `@deepseek-ai/dsh-storage-domain` entry to the pro"},{"id":"p14s12","text":"file's `package.json` as a stopgap, remove it too — it will trip the same gate on the next host upgr"},{"id":"p14s13","text":"ge.json` as a stopgap, remove it too — it will trip the same gate on the next host upgrade.\n[该节后续省略]"},{"id":"p15s1","text":"## Install"},{"id":"p16s1","text":"Install with the dsh CLI — it installs the package into the profile and registers the bundle for you"},{"id":"p16s2","text":". The stable channel is shown below; for the next channel use the `@next` command from the Versions "},{"id":"p16s3","text":"table (`up` / `rm` take the same spec):"},{"id":"p17s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p18s1","text":"Then restart `dsh web` and refresh the browser. `dsh plugin` reconciles the profile's bundle list fo"},{"id":"p18s2","text":"r you — nothing to edit by hand."},{"id":"p19s1","text":"Upgrade and removal use the same command:"},{"id":"p20s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p21s1","text":"If you manage a profile without the CLI, the manual equivalent is to add the package with pnpm insid"},{"id":"p21s2","text":"e the profile directory and list it in `dsh.profile.bundles` yourself:"},{"id":"p22s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p23s1","text":"## Known Limitations and Deferred Work"},{"id":"p24s1","text":"- **`/preset`, `/skill`, and `/host` stay deregistered** — their control modules are implemented and"},{"id":"p24s2","text":" unit-tested and return when the router wires them (the `/preset` thread-context guard rides along)."},{"id":"p24s3","text":"\n- **Verbosity is a single global setting** (the DSH ecosystem has per-channel precedent).\n- **Defer"},{"id":"p24s4","text":"red after a Kimaki parity pass**: reconcile-interactions wiring, typing pause during ask waits, fail"},{"id":"p24s5","text":"-closed binding/session-owner store wiring, and credential-rotation watching.\n- **Known tension**: t"},{"id":"p24s6","text":"he 250ms minimum stream-edit interval against Discord's edit budget under heavy load (429s self-heal"},{"id":"p24s7","text":"), and typing has no duration-capped watchdog."}],"truncated":true}","role":"user"}],"model":"MiniMax-M3.1-Flash","reasoning_effort":"low","stream":false}
